{"seq":2,"slug":"routing-evaluation","title":"路由评测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-routing-cascades/practice/routing-evaluation","wordCount":1877,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"路由评测\">路由评测</h1><p>路由策略上线前必须回答：相对固定模型基线，它在什么质量约束下省了多少完整成本；错误集中在哪些请求；模型、effort、provider 或价格变化后结论是否仍成立。评的不是一个分类器，而是「策略 + 候选快照 + 推理强度 + 执行协议 + 价格快照」组成的系统。缺任一身份，漂亮曲线都不可复现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-先定义实验-arm\">核心概念：先定义实验 arm</h2><p>把 <code>model</code> 当成 arm 远远不够。一个可复现实验 arm 至少是：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"arm_id = hash(&#10;  model_snapshot,&#10;  effort,&#10;  provider_constraints,&#10;  prompt_and_template_version,&#10;  tool_protocol,&#10;  decoding_parameters,&#10;  price_snapshot&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>arm_id = hash(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  model_snapshot,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  effort,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  provider_constraints,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  prompt_and_template_version,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  tool_protocol,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  decoding_parameters,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  price_snapshot</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>同一模型改 effort 就是新 arm；alias 解析到新快照也是新 arm；工具 schema 或 chat template 变化仍会改变行为。provider 若只影响可用性可以作为分层变量，若不同端点有量化、上下文、工具能力或审查差异，就必须进入 arm 身份。</p>\n<p>路由器本身也要钉住 <code>policy_version</code>、候选集 hash、特征版本与阈值。离线回放时，从 route receipt 还原「当时可选什么、最终选了什么」，而不是拿今天的注册表解释昨天的请求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两层评测-离线筛选-在线拍板\">两层评测：离线筛选，在线拍板</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Spec[冻结 arm/策略/数据协议] --&gt; Off[离线回放与前沿]&#10;  Off --&gt; Gate{离线质量门}&#10;  Gate --&gt;|失败| Stop[停止/改策略]&#10;  Gate --&gt;|通过| Shadow[影子决策]&#10;  Shadow --&gt; Canary[低风险灰度]&#10;  Canary --&gt; AB[在线随机对照]&#10;  AB --&gt; Promote{业务与风险门}&#10;  Promote --&gt;|通过| Rollout[分阶段放量]&#10;  Promote --&gt;|失败| Rollback[回滚]\">flowchart TD\n  Spec[冻结 arm/策略/数据协议] --&gt; Off[离线回放与前沿]\n  Off --&gt; Gate{离线质量门}\n  Gate --&gt;|失败| Stop[停止/改策略]\n  Gate --&gt;|通过| Shadow[影子决策]\n  Shadow --&gt; Canary[低风险灰度]\n  Canary --&gt; AB[在线随机对照]\n  AB --&gt; Promote{业务与风险门}\n  Promote --&gt;|通过| Rollout[分阶段放量]\n  Promote --&gt;|失败| Rollback[回滚]</pre><p>离线评测快、可复现，适合扫描阈值并画成本—质量前沿。在线评测捕获真实用户反馈、provider 容量与尾延迟，适合最后拍板。影子阶段只记录新策略选择，不改变用户路径；灰度阶段才让少量低风险流量执行新 arm。两层都不可省：离线数据会偏离生产，直接在线探索又会把误路由损失交给用户。</p>\n<h2 id=\"离线前沿-同一裁判-完整成本-独立数据\">离线前沿：同一裁判、完整成本、独立数据</h2><p>对每个请求收集所有候选 arm 的结果与质量，按策略选择 arm，再计算整体质量和完整成本。若强模型使用比例为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，可在多个预算点比较路由质量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_r(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、随机基线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{rand}(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 和先知上界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{oracle}(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。APGR 一类指标可以压缩整条曲线，但不能替代原始分层结果。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{APGR}=\\frac{1}{|C|}\\sum_{c\\in C}\n\\frac{Q_r(c)-Q_{rand}(c)}{Q_{oracle}(c)-Q_{rand}(c)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">APGR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7487em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>离线核查有五个硬门。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>硬门</th>\n<th>合格证据</th>\n<th>常见造假方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>裁判一致</td>\n<td>所有 arm 用同一 rubric/协议</td>\n<td>强弱模型用不同 judge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据独立</td>\n<td>训练、阈值校准、最终评测请求不重叠</td>\n<td>用训练偏好直接画前沿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布贴近</td>\n<td>按线上任务、租户、风险与长度分层抽样</td>\n<td>只用容易的公开聊天集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完整成本</td>\n<td>路由器、judge、白跑、失败尝试、工具均计入</td>\n<td>只算最终模型 token</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>身份冻结</td>\n<td>模型/effort/provider/协议/价格都有快照</td>\n<td>用可漂移 alias 和当前价回算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>质量不能只看均值。至少报告高风险子集的 false downgrade rate、每类任务的 regret、最坏分位与灾难错误数。若某类请求一次错误不可逆，应设独立硬门，而不是允许其他简单请求的高分把它平均掉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基准告诉我们什么-也告诉我们什么不能外推\">基准告诉我们什么，也告诉我们什么不能外推</h2><p>RouteLLM 在 ICLR 2025 中提供二元强弱模型路由、成本—质量指标与可复现实验，是理解分类器路由的良好起点（<a href=\"https://proceedings.iclr.cc/paper_files/paper/2025/file/5503a7c69d48a2f86fc00b3dc09de686-Paper-Conference.pdf\">RouteLLM</a>）。RouterBench 收集了超过 405,000 条推理结果，用统一数据比较多模型路由，说明候选池与任务覆盖对结论至关重要（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.12031\">RouterBench</a>）。</p>\n<p>2026 年的 LLMRouterBench 进一步统一 21 个数据集、33 个模型和 10 类代表性路由基线。其关键发现不是「某个复杂路由器必胜」，而是统一协议下许多方法表现接近，一些近期方法与商业路由并未稳定超过简单基线，且与 oracle 仍有明显差距（<a href=\"https://aclanthology.org/2026.findings-acl.1881/\">LLMRouterBench, Findings of ACL 2026</a>）。这对生产团队有两个直接提醒：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>必须包含 fixed-best、random、简单规则或轻量分类器等强基线，不能只和明显差的全量小模型比。</li>\n<li>公共 benchmark 证明方法可能有效，不证明它适合你的流量；真实工具协议、语言、租户、风险与价格仍要本地重测。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>同模型 effort 路由还需要 effort sweep：固定模型快照，对每个支持档位收集质量、输出 token、思考 token（若可见）、工具调用数与延迟。不能假设档位质量严格单调，也不能把不支持的档位补成零结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在线实验-随机化单位与污染控制\">在线实验：随机化单位与污染控制</h2><p>在线 A/B 的随机化单位通常不是单条消息。多轮会话若在中途换策略，会产生上下文与缓存污染；更稳妥的是按用户或会话稳定分桶，并在实验期固定策略与 arm 版本。Agent 工作流还可能有长时任务，应按 run 分桶，防止同一任务前后步骤跨实验组。</p>\n<p>在线指标至少分四组：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>质量</strong>：任务完成率、人工抽检、重试/纠正、工具结果验证、高风险错误。</li>\n<li><strong>经济</strong>：完整每任务成本、预算耗尽率、白跑率、路由器与 judge 成本。</li>\n<li><strong>性能</strong>：TTFT、完成延迟、p95/p99、排队、超时、各档到达率。</li>\n<li><strong>可靠性</strong>：provider fallback、重试、拒绝、alias 变化、缺失 receipt、重复副作用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>灰度放量应由联合门控制。例如质量非劣、成本达到最小收益、p99 不恶化超过阈值、灾难错误为零。统计显著不等于业务可接受：极大流量下微小差异也显著，仍要先定义最小有意义效应和错误预算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"漂移与持续评测\">漂移与持续评测</h2><p>路由前沿会因三类变化失效：输入分布变了，候选模型/effort 变了，价格或 provider 容量变了。监控要区分数据漂移、概念漂移和执行漂移。prompt 长度变化是数据漂移；同类请求的最佳 arm 改变是概念漂移；requested model 与 resolved model 不一致增加则是执行漂移。</p>\n<p>触发重测的事件包括：模型快照或 alias 更新、价格变化、effort 支持表变化、system prompt/tool schema 更新、provider 量化/区域变化、任务分布越界，以及高风险误路由超预算。定时重测只是兜底，事件触发更及时。</p>\n<p>历史样本要保留必要的可回放输入与最小证据，同时遵守隐私保留边界。不能为了评测无限期保存原始提示；可采用分层抽样、脱敏、派生特征与受控审计样本，并记录数据版本和删除策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>实验 arm 是模型快照、effort、provider 约束、提示/工具协议、解码和价格快照的组合，不是一个裸 model 名。</li>\n<li>离线前沿负责筛选，影子与在线随机实验负责拍板；高风险请求需要独立硬门。</li>\n<li>完整成本必须包含路由器、judge、级联白跑、失败尝试和工具成本。</li>\n<li>RouterBench 与 LLMRouterBench 提供统一比较框架，也提醒复杂方法未必稳定超过简单基线。</li>\n<li>模型、effort、协议、价格或执行解析变化都要触发重测，alias 不能充当可复现实验身份。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../foundations/cost-quality-frontier\">成本-质量前沿</a> —— 前沿与 APGR 的数学直觉。</li>\n<li>同章上一节：<a href=\"routing-gateways\">路由网关与中间件</a> —— arm 身份与 execution receipt 的来源。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../training/online-routing-bandits\">在线路由与赌博机</a> —— 在线奖励与探索约束。</li>\n<li>同章下一节：<a href=\"routing-in-practice\">落地与权衡</a> —— 将评测门变成发布和回滚机制。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"路由评测","id":"路由评测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：先定义实验 arm","id":"核心概念-先定义实验-arm"},{"level":2,"text":"两层评测：离线筛选，在线拍板","id":"两层评测-离线筛选-在线拍板"},{"level":2,"text":"离线前沿：同一裁判、完整成本、独立数据","id":"离线前沿-同一裁判-完整成本-独立数据"},{"level":2,"text":"基准告诉我们什么，也告诉我们什么不能外推","id":"基准告诉我们什么-也告诉我们什么不能外推"},{"level":2,"text":"在线实验：随机化单位与污染控制","id":"在线实验-随机化单位与污染控制"},{"level":2,"text":"漂移与持续评测","id":"漂移与持续评测"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"路由网关与中间件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-routing-cascades/practice/routing-gateways"},"next":{"title":"落地与权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-routing-cascades/practice/routing-in-practice"}}